          ],
          "plaintext": "Bryan Newbold, protocol engineer for Bluesky, joined us to discuss DID PLC, a self-authenticating decentralized identifier that is key to account portability on the Bluesky social network."
        },
        {
          "$type": "app.offprint.block.webEmbed",
          "alignment": "center",
          "description": "Enjoy the videos and music you love, upload original content, and share it all with friends, family, and the world on YouTube.",
